title: Preparing the Defense
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
tags: event
view-if: german_negotiations >= 4
go-to: defense_menu

= Preparing the Defense

With the threat of counterrevolution and attacks by the imperialists rising, it's crucial that we prepare our defenses. 

Though the garrison in Petrograd is generally loyal to us, there are concerns they'll be less enthused about actual mobilization into combat should that become necessary.

@defense_menu
  
- @mobilize_garrison
- @mobilize_workers
- @lsr_detachments
- @trade_unions
- @nothing

@mobilize_garrison
title: Mobilize reinforcements from the city garrison to the frontlines. 
max-visits: 1
go-to: defense_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.garrison_militancy -= 0.2;
  Q.garrison_b_loyalty *= 0.95;
  Q.soldiers_b -= 2; Q.soldiers_unrest += 5; 
!}

The soldiers are refusing to board the trains and be sent off to the front! Though pledging to defend the capital, it seems only the most ardent of our supporters among the garrison can stomach actual mobilization. 

@mobilize_workers
title: Mobilize workers to form militias in the capital. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – We lack the resources.
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
max-visits: 1
go-to: defense_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5;
  Q.workers_militia_strength += 5; 
  Q.workers_b -= 2; Q.workers_unrest += 5; 
!}

Although we manage to recruit a number of Bolshevik suppoters into the worker militias, it appears that recruitment is hampered by rising inflation, unemployment, and general disillusionment. Though many support the Revolution, enthusiasm for prolonged military service in support of it is low. 

@trade_unions
title: Charge the trade unions with mobilizing and organizing workers for the defense. 
max-visits: 1
go-to: defense_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.unionists_strength += 2; 
  Q.workers_militia_strength += Math.max(0, (Q.unionists / 1500) * (Q.unionists_strength / 50) * (Q.unionists_unrest / 100)); 
!}

The trade unions help spur the workers to action in defense of the Revolution. 
  
@lsr_detachments
title: Encourage the <span style="color: var(--lsr-color); font-weight: bold;">Left-SRs</span> to form combat squads too, and have them recruit from their supporters for the capital's defense. 
max-visits: 1
go-to: defense_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.lsr_relation += 5; Q.lsr_strength += 5; 
  Q.workers_militia_strength += 5; 
  Q.city_militia_lsr_loyalty += 15;
  Q.workers_unrest += 5; 
!}

@nothing
title: We've done all we can.
go-to: root 
